raye-settings (1.0~beta2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * New page, Accounts > Files from Windows: copy Documents, Pictures, Music,
    Videos, Downloads and the Desktop of each Windows account (or from a USB
    drive), with the wallpaper and browser favorites; the Windows drive is
    opened read-only, every file is checked after copying, a stopped copy
    picks up where it was, and after the first sign-in a notification
    offers it when Windows is on the PC.
  * Personalization offers a Windows 10 desktop style; Taskbar alignment
    stays on the left in it. The "Windows open and close" switch now
    follows Raye's own window effect.
  * Gaming > Game Mode: a switch for Game Mode, what it does while you
    play, and every game it found, each of which can be turned off (or on,
    for a Windows program).
  * Settings gives back the memory of pages you have left, and more of it
    while minimized.

